      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「魔列車が走っている理由」は\r\n彼らに関係があるのかも。",
        "official_en": "In fact, those soldiers may be very closely related to why we’ve got a phantom train on our hands.",
        "real_en": "The reason this phantom train is running might have something to do with those soldiers."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
