        "key": "ChrEv_0410_003_01_024",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0410_003_01:ChrEv_0410_003_01_024:9e2a10a9",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0410_003_01:ChrEv_0410_003_01_024:9e2a10a9",
        "jp_sha256": "6d7311f6c6d3f353cdd19fc78f8990908a05aa139d24378247fb1b7bc2c1f212",
        "official_en_sha256": "459e633118241c679c21468b7bda082b970d035739298910f65498f27a2848a3"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの兵士たちはヴィルヘルム将軍の報告を\r\nシエラ皇太子に伝えようとしていたよな。",
        "official_en": "It looks like the soldiers here were trying to deliver his report to Prince Shera.",
        "real_en": "It looks like the soldiers here were trying to deliver his report to Crown Prince Shera."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
