      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ええ、有名な将軍よ。\r\nソゼ皇帝に反旗を翻して処刑されたの。",
        "official_en": "Sure, he was quite the famous general. He was executed after staging a rebellion against Emperor Sozhe.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
