        "official_en_sha256": "7be078d7f964d12f757db118ad974bbeacdf70828fa24bc8604fc5d63db00330"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "かつて幽霊船の調査を依頼されてね。\r\nその船には死者の無念を\r\n利用する魔物が巣食っていたわ。",
        "official_en": "I was tasked with investigating a ghost ship a while back. It was haunted by a monster who lived off the victims’ lingering regrets.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
